Woman: No, you need the number 12. This one goes to the airport.
Man: Oh, I see. Where can I catch the number 12?
Woman: Just across the street, at the stop next to the pharmacy.', 'What is this bus''s actual destination?', '[{"id":"a","text":"The central library"},{"id":"b","text":"The airport"},{"id":"c","text":"The pharmacy"},{"id":"d","text":"It has no destination mentioned"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'The woman says, "This one goes to the airport."', 'easy', array['listening-comprehension']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('q-listening-3', 'listening', null, null, '/audio/listening/q-listening-1.mp3', 'Man: Excuse me, does this bus go to the central library?
Woman: No, you need the number 12. This one goes to the airport.
Man: Oh, I see. Where can I catch the number 12?
Woman: Just across the street, at the stop next to the pharmacy.', 'What can be inferred about the man at the start of the conversation?', '[{"id":"a","text":"He works at the pharmacy."},{"id":"b","text":"He is unsure which bus to take."},{"id":"c","text":"He is the bus driver."},{"id":"d","text":"He has taken this bus many times before."}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'He asks whether the bus goes to the library, showing he isn''t sure he''s on the right one.', 'medium', array['listening-inference']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('q-listening-4', 'listening', null, null, '/audio/listening/q-listening-4.mp3', 'Woman: Did you finish the quarterly report?
Man: Almost. I just need the sales figures from Ahmed.
Woman: He''s out sick today, unfortunately.
Man: Then I''ll use last month''s figures as an estimate and update it tomorrow.', 'Why hasn''t the man finished the report?', '[{"id":"a","text":"He is waiting for figures from a colleague who is absent."},{"id":"b","text":"He doesn''t know how to write reports."},{"id":"c","text":"The report was already submitted."},{"id":"d","text":"The woman didn''t approve it yet."}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'He says he needs sales figures from Ahmed, who "is out sick today."', 'medium', array['listening-comprehension']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
