Man: Almost. I just need the sales figures from Ahmed.
Woman: He''s out sick today, unfortunately.
Man: Then I''ll use last month''s figures as an estimate and update it tomorrow.', 'What does the man decide to do?', '[{"id":"a","text":"Cancel the report"},{"id":"b","text":"Wait until Ahmed returns"},{"id":"c","text":"Use an estimate now and update it later"},{"id":"d","text":"Ask the woman to write it instead"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'He says, "I''ll use last month''s figures as an estimate and update it tomorrow."', 'medium', array['listening-comprehension']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
