Man: Almost. I just need the sales figures from Ahmed.
Woman: He''s out sick today, unfortunately.
Man: Then I''ll use last month''s figures as an estimate and update it tomorrow.', 'What is the relationship between the two speakers, most likely?', '[{"id":"a","text":"Doctor and patient"},{"id":"b","text":"Coworkers"},{"id":"c","text":"Strangers on a bus"},{"id":"d","text":"Teacher and student"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'They discuss a shared quarterly report and a colleague, suggesting a workplace context.', 'hard', array['listening-inference']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('q-listening-7', 'listening', null, null, '/audio/listening/q-listening-7.mp3', 'Woman: Good evening, Almas Restaurant, how can I help you?
Man: Hi, I''d like to book a table for four people this Saturday at eight.
Woman: I''m sorry, eight o''clock is fully booked, but we do have a table available at six thirty, or nine fifteen.
Man: Nine fifteen works better for us, actually.
Woman: Great, I''ve booked a table for four at nine fifteen this Saturday.', 'What time did the man originally request?', '[{"id":"a","text":"Nine fifteen"},{"id":"b","text":"Eight o''clock"},{"id":"c","text":"Six thirty"},{"id":"d","text":"This Sunday"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'The man first asks for "this Saturday at eight," before being offered other times.', 'easy', array['listening-comprehension']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
