Woman: I''m sorry, eight o''clock is fully booked, but we do have a table available at six thirty, or nine fifteen.
Man: Nine fifteen works better for us, actually.
Woman: Great, I''ve booked a table for four at nine fifteen this Saturday.', 'What time was the reservation finally made for?', '[{"id":"a","text":"Six thirty"},{"id":"b","text":"Eight o''clock"},{"id":"c","text":"Nine fifteen"},{"id":"d","text":"Ten o''clock"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'The man says nine fifteen "works better," and the woman confirms the booking at that time.', 'easy', array['listening-comprehension']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
