Student: Only two units? That''s great news. Thank you, teacher.
Teacher: You''re welcome. Study hard and good luck to all of you.', 'How does the student feel when she hears that only the last two units are on the exam?', '[{"id":"a","text":"Surprised and relieved"},{"id":"b","text":"Annoyed that the exam is too easy"},{"id":"c","text":"Confused about the exam date"},{"id":"d","text":"Worried that she has not studied enough"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'The student reacts with surprise and says it is great news, which shows she is relieved that there is less material to study.', 'medium', array['listening-inference','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-listening-4', 'listening', null, null, null, 'Lecturer: Our lecture today is about SAD, which stands for Seasonal Affective Disorder, a kind of depression that appears at certain times of the year. Before I continue, do you have any questions?
Student: Yes, sir. Why is SAD considered a seasonal disorder?
Lecturer: Because it happens during the dark months, when the days become shorter and the sky is usually cloudy.
Student: And what actually causes SAD?
Lecturer: Honestly, no one really knows what causes it. But fortunately, there is a treatment called light box therapy. It can relieve the symptoms, and sometimes it works better when combined with other medication.
Student: Is that treatment widely available now?
Lecturer: Not yet. Scientists are still testing the light boxes to make sure they are safe and effective.', 'What information proves that SAD is a seasonal disorder?', '[{"id":"a","text":"It only affects people in hot countries"},{"id":"b","text":"It happens in the dark months of the year"},{"id":"c","text":"It is caused by eating too much sugar"},{"id":"d","text":"It lasts for a whole decade"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'The lecturer explains that SAD occurs during the dark months, when days become shorter and the sky is usually cloudy.', 'easy', array['listening-comprehension','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
