Professor: It certainly was. Yet despite these challenges, she became one of the most beloved writers in English literature. She passed away in 1817, but her books are still read and loved today.', 'What is the most important point mentioned about Jane Austen''s career?', '[{"id":"a","text":"She had to hide her identity when publishing her novels"},{"id":"b","text":"She wrote only short stories"},{"id":"c","text":"Her novels were never published"},{"id":"d","text":"She studied literature at university"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'The professor emphasizes that Austen had to hide her identity when publishing, because women writers were not taken seriously at the time.', 'hard', array['listening-inference','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
